{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前接受局部肺部切除手術的教宗良十四世（Pope Leo XIV），周六（17日）在術後第四天下午獲准出院返回梵蒂岡。</p><p>71歲的良十四世離開羅馬傑梅利醫院（Gemelli Hospital）時無需他人扶持，並停下步伐向院外的祝賀者說話及揮手致意，現場聚集的大批信眾隨即發出歡呼與掌聲。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:39:40.656667+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:03:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:57:32.388049+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:38:22.429013+00:00","content_hash":"d4fb36fb21fc92684fc447d4bb5779b3b9494f0d5264910336cbcda6e410c013","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}